How should I take the Longevity Shot, and when is the best time?</p></span></div><div data-rid="014e0340-dc2e-4c4a-ae90-e37e21b2b87e" class="r-db6c6e"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-sbxu2o" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1bb2:"><div data-rid="35ecc89c-41a3-4d78-9350-f1539f024e25" class="r-csqcde"><div data-rid="a1759fbd-c982-46d5-9a89-b0e822a46ff5" class="r-cc0w4l alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>For optimal results, we recommend taking two shots per week, at any time of the day. This schedule helps maintain NAD+ levels and activate sirtuins—proteins vital for cellular health, DNA repair, and metabolic function. This intermittent dosing supports long-term vitality and overall longevity, slowing the aging process without overwhelming your body.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="43cd2684-3e7a-4de1-a5c2-04798dc4af75" class="r-194q1mc" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="f1628839-4665-4f4d-b28b-492fe2fb1d05" aria-controls="replo-:R1rb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1qgjznh"><div data-rid="a110ae38-14cd-4671-af37-6691e0d945d1" class="r-qzucsc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>When will I see results from the Longevity Shot?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a80d647a-351b-4e0a-811a-d05282ad55e8" class="r-ykhh1s"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-z93q86" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class