><div data-rid="093ae053-fa9e-4b82-ae32-b9407daff058" class="r-seetk1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are there any side effects of interactions with medications?</p></span></div><div data-rid="f1b63736-3451-4031-a474-48ea08037f8e" class="r-1bs2x23"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1vogsa8" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2rb2:"><div data-rid="03aa44bd-bd67-461f-b8fb-44b0d51894cc" class="r-1614dgc"><div data-rid="5c6f0986-09c4-43ce-8fb3-5bbb1c2345ac" class="r-wrd8s8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The natural ingredients in the Longevity Shot are generally well-tolerated, but everyone is unique. If you’re taking any prescription medications or have a medical condition, particularly autoimmune conditions, we encourage you to consult your healthcare provider before starting the Longevity Shot.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="346bd25d-6e46-4cd7-a170-65dbda1e06b5" class="r-1n0avab" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="95125565-6243-460f-8c88-ffbada5475fc" aria-controls="replo-:R3bb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1o1use8"><div data-rid="0477f764-dd32-483f-9f63-fbb187cad09a" class="r-jq9kuz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Does the Longevity Shot contain sugar or alcohol?</p></span></div><div data-rid="c7bf3c02-3159-4802-b86e-442df7af9968" class="r-2z2ecg"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1szc206" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3bb2:"><div data-rid="ef191908-6427-475f-927c-35c0854bbd36" class="r-p4eilc"><div data-rid="cff9f9f1-4e1c-4595-93e9-5adc8131a4b2" class="r-1m5e2q3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Longevity Shot contains 2.5 grams of natural sugar from apple and grape juice concentrate. It is also lightly sweetened with steviol glycosides, a natural sweetener derived from the Stevia rebaudiana plant that is sugar and calorie-free. It is alcohol-free.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="7a98c4e0-6eec-479f-8741-ffbaa629e952" class="r-17ykk7q" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="bdc49584-a699-4b82-96e4-5bc2afde0596" aria-controls="replo-:R3rb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-6yk2xl"><div data-rid="e2924e90-27e4-4fc9-afe0-e30d62ecbb99" class="r-69rl6j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take the Longevity Shot if I’m pregnant or breastfeeding?</p></span></div><div data-rid="dec6f560-58d6-47b5-9f4f-e8ef35d683b6" class="r-1us7g91"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-jqswp8" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3rb2:"><div data-rid="c77bfbfa-077b-4411-84c5-9d12cbd8b8f0" class="r-1nsrq7l"><div data-rid="c26c5aaa-5120-4617-9607-e5a105e286fc" class="r-qkxpei alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>While the Longevity Shot is made with natural ingredients, we always recommend that pregnant or breastfeeding women consult their healthcare provider to ensure it aligns with their unique health needs during this time.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="36d8d5fb-df31-4287-bb48-abb0fe1c7c83" class="r-17nwt2t" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="74ff5f50-f528-4dff-8161-deb800a1f9d2" aria-controls="replo-:R4bb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-18ob1rk"><div data-rid="1cd0f499-9e64-489d-aaf7-203aac3f43ab" class="r-1yczd0e alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the Longevity Shot suitable for children or teenagers?</p></span></div><div data-rid="2dfb8c6a-800e-4f18-a55a-4fa9217eaeb2" class="r-j3kczb"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1s9nm4a" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R4bb2:"><div data-rid="e5ab58e5-8f2b-4234-aa37-40a142dae57e" class="r-lzvs1f"><div data-rid="e08dd3b2-ffe0-464b-b5ef-f8f849917efd" class="r-1zhy2a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Longevity Shot is formulated with adults in mind. If you’re considering it for children or teenagers, we recommend speaking with a healthcare provider to ensure it’s appropriate for their needs.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="bb90e1c6-1be9-41b7-ba51-e852171f1869" class="r-h3621v" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="0cfb2e42-3cbe-4589-aa1a-3799127e0ff7" aria-controls="replo-:R4rb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-170qfku"><div data-rid="9ef966bb-66ce-4028-b59b-659faab455de" class="r-qp3vqv alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the Longevity Shot safe for those with allergies or dietary restrictions?</p></span></div><div data-rid="2229bfcc-1953-42c8-8af4-d15a88fe3409" class="r-1vieyex"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1sjyyml" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R4rb2:"><div data-rid="61d90491-4030-4a41-a737-c5839e66bad5" class="r-1qrnole"><div data-rid="da61f733-4c23-4e10-9db8-3c77322623e3" class="r-1mevlrx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, the Longevity Shot is free from common allergens like nuts, soy, dairy, and gluten, making it suitable for most women with dietary sensitivities. Additionally, it can fit into most keto diets.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="7a379224-31cc-4733-abc6-aa503b0fb9ec" class="r-1oglrtp" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="4c79695c-01ed-47e3-9a30-0e071daa5482" aria-controls="replo-:R5bb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-i2ntnr"><div data-rid="3e419f74-3072-489d-a018-a22e80fb0547" class="r-c1xp65 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the Longevity Shots tested on animals?</p></span></div><div data-rid="080c67b6-7d8c-4620-b011-f75cf8c23319" class="r-e8i4ei"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1827rka" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5bb2:"><div data-rid="969869f7-1101-4012-8edf-98acabe0ef31" class="r-phc7g5"><div data-rid="2fcad570-1667-4bf2-afaf-a404820f7063" class="r-1sr6x2a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>No, the Longevity Shot is not tested on animals.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="30bcaa38-a1be-4d7b-8c6a-7ae1dcb59b85" class="r-2hntnj" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="5f69992c-33fb-48bb-8620-b78e8549c370" aria-controls="replo-:R5rb2: